{
  "id": 8860498133191,
  "title": "Custom Soccer Player Paint Splatter Comforter Set, Machine Washable",
  "handle": "custom-soccer-player-paint-splatter-comforter-set-machine-washable",
  "body_html": "<p>Unleash your child's passion for soccer with this custom comforter set from Jeminise. Designed for young enthusiasts, it's the perfect way to transform their room into a tribute to their favorite sport and inspire their soccer dreams.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soccer Enthusiasm:</strong> Designed for young soccer fans, inspiring dreams and excitement for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin, US Full, US Queen, and US King to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Features a hidden zipper and smooth metal pull for effortless duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection techniques to prevent fading and ensure smooth, compact stitching for lasting quality.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Machine Washable:</strong> Simple care; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one duvet cover.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name and number for a unique touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name &amp; Number</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Width</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Sham Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
